#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:4
msgid ":index:`First Run Wizard <wizard; first run>`"
msgstr ":index:`首次运行向导 <wizard; first run>`"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:6
msgid "Starting with version 3.0, Picard includes a \"First Run Wizard\" that is displayed the first time Picard is run after installation. The wizard allows the user to configure some basic settings and to choose whether to enable or disable certain features. These settings can be changed later in the Options dialog, but the wizard provides a convenient way to configure some basic settings when Picard is first run."
msgstr ""
"从 3.0 版本开始，Picard 包含一个 \"首次运行向导\"，在安装后第一次运行 Picard "
"时会显示。向导允许用户配置一些基本设置，并选择是否启用或禁用某些功能。这些设"
"置可以在选项对话框中稍后更改，但向导在首次运行 Picard 时提供了一个方便配置基"
"本设置的方式。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:10
msgid "Initial Warning"
msgstr "初始警告"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:12
msgid "The first screen displays a warning that Picard is a powerful tool that can modify your music files."
msgstr "第一个屏幕显示一个警告，说明 Picard 是一个强大的工具，可以修改你的音乐文件。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:27
msgid "This screen provides some recommendations, including a link to the on-line documentation. There is an option to display this warning again, each time Picard is started."
msgstr ""
"这个屏幕提供了一些建议，包括指向在线文档的链接。有一个选项可以在每次启动 "
"Picard 时再次显示此警告。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:31
msgid "Setup Wizard"
msgstr "设置向导"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:33
msgid "Once the initial warning screen is acknowledged, the setup wizard is displayed the first time Picard is started. This wizard allows the user to configure some basic settings and to choose whether to enable or disable certain features."
msgstr ""
"在确认初始警告屏幕后，在第一次启动 Picard 时会显示设置向导。此向导允许用户配"
"置一些基本设置，并选择是否启用或禁用某些功能。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:48
msgid "This initial setup wizard screen also provides a link to the documentation."
msgstr "这个初始设置向导屏幕还提供了一个指向文档的链接。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:52
msgid "Setup Wizard - File Organization"
msgstr "设置向导 - 文件组织"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:54
msgid "This is the first setting screen of the setup wizard, which allows the user to configure how Picard will organize music files."
msgstr "这是设置向导的第一个设置屏幕，允许用户配置 Picard 将如何组织音乐文件。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:69
msgid "This screen allows the user to choose whether tagged files should be renamed based upon the metadata tags in the files, and whether the files should be moved to a different location. The file location folder structure is determined using a :doc:`file naming script <../extending/scripts>`, and the user can specify the main directory under which the folder structure is created."
msgstr ""
"这个屏幕允许用户选择是否根据文件中的元数据标签重命名带标签的文件，以及是否将"
"文件移动到不同的位置。文件位置文件夹结构是使用 :doc:`file naming script <../"
"extending/scripts>` 确定的，用户可以指定创建文件夹结构的主目录。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:73
msgid "Setup Wizard - Cover Art"
msgstr "设置向导 - 封面图片"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:75
msgid "The next screen of the setup wizard allows the user to configure how Picard should handle cover art."
msgstr "设置向导的下一个屏幕允许用户配置 Picard 应该如何处理封面图片。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:90
msgid "This screen allows the user to choose whether tagged files should have cover art images embedded in the audio files, and if the cover art image files should be saved in the folder with the audio files."
msgstr ""
"这个屏幕允许用户选择是否带标签的文件应在音频文件中嵌入封面图片，以及封面图片"
"文件是否应与音频文件保存在同一个文件夹中。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:92
msgid "It also allows the user to choose if release group cover art is used instead of cover art for the specific release. Release group cover art usually provides higher quality images, but they may not exactly match the cover for your specific release."
msgstr ""
"它还允许用户选择是否使用发行组封面图片而不是特定发行的封面图片。发行组封面图"
"片通常提供更高质量的图片，但它们可能不会与您的特定发行完全匹配。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:96
msgid "Setup Wizard - Additional Metadata"
msgstr "设置向导 - 额外元数据"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:98
msgid "The next screen of the setup wizard allows the user to configure how much detail Picard retrieves from MusicBrainz."
msgstr "设置向导的下一个屏幕允许用户配置 Picard 从 MusicBrainz 获取多少详细信息。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:113
msgid "This screen allows the user to choose whether Picard should include detailed track relationships such as performers and composers when downloading album information from MusicBrainz. This additional information could include the composer and performers for each track."
msgstr ""
"这个屏幕允许用户选择是否在从 MusicBrainz 下载专辑信息时，Picard 应该包含详细"
"的音轨关系，例如表演者和作曲家。这些额外信息可能包括每首音轨的作曲家和表演者"
"。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:117
msgid "Setup Wizard - Updates"
msgstr "设置向导 - 更新"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:119
msgid "The final screen of the setup wizard allows the user to configure how Picard should handle checking for updates."
msgstr "设置向导的最后一个屏幕允许用户配置 Picard 应该如何处理检查更新。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:134
msgid "Picard can be configured to automatically check for the following updates:"
msgstr "Picard 可以配置为自动检查以下更新："

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:136
msgid "New versions of Picard. Note that this option will not be available if Picard was installed from a package manager, as the package manager will handle updates."
msgstr ""
"Picard 的新版本。请注意，如果 Picard 是从包管理器安装的，则此选项将不可用，因"
"为包管理器将处理更新。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:137
msgid "New versions of installed plugins."
msgstr "已安装插件的新版本。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:138
msgid "New versions of the documentation, including available translations of the documentation. Picard will automatically try to display the appropriate version of the documentation in the user's preferred language, if a translation is available. If a translation is not available, Picard will display the documentation in English."
msgstr ""
"新版本的文档，包括可用的文档翻译。Picard 将自动尝试在用户的偏好语言中显示适当"
"的文档版本，如果翻译可用。如果翻译不可用，Picard 将显示英文文档。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_run.rst:142
msgid "The update checks will only be performed if the computer is connected to the Internet. The update checks for new versions of the program and installed plugins will provide notifications when updates are available, but will **not** automatically download and install them."
msgstr ""
"更新检查只有在计算机连接到互联网时才会执行。程序和已安装插件的更新检查会在有"
"更新可用时提供通知，但**不会**自动下载和安装它们。"
